 "stimulus_html": "Consider the dataset 2, 5, 8, 16, 12, 1, 8, 6, 15, 4.",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 529178,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "What value is at the 80th percentile?\n",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>If <i>p</i> percent of the values in a dataset are less than a number <i>n</i>, then we say that <i>n</i> is at the <i>p</i>th percentile.</p>\n<p>First, put the data in increasing order: 1, 2, 4, 5, 6, 8, 8, 12, 15, 16</p>\n<p>There are 10 data values.</p>\n<p>Eight out of the 10 numbers, or 80%, are less than the 9<sup>th</sup> number, 15.</p>\n<p>The value at the 80<sup>th</sup> percentile is 15.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "15\n"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 529179,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "At what percentile is the value 12?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
